{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "Telekom DPS APIs",
    "description": "DPS HAL APIs used by `svc/mcp_telekom_identity/dps_get_client.py` — party-management 3.54.0, customer-management 4.67.0, product-inventory 4.64.\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Import the matching environment file (`telekom-dps-test.postman_environment.json`) and select it in the top-right Environment dropdown.\n2. Fill in `bearer_token` in the environment.\n3. **VPN required** for `teai.st.sk:8243`.\n\n**Auto-headers:** Every request auto-generates fresh UUIDs for `X-Request-Id`, `X-Request-Tracking-Id`, `X-Request-Session-Id` via collection-level pre-request script. Override per-request if you want to trace something specific.\n\nGroups:\n- **Party Management** — identify a party by RČ/OP/pas/IČO, fetch single party\n- **Customer Management** — fetch customer, billing account, related sub-resources\n- **Product Inventory** — MSISDN lookup, product details, per-customer counts\n- **End-to-end flows** — composed requests that mirror the live `identifikacia_*` tools",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{bearer_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Auto-generate the three required tracing UUIDs.",
          "// Override these on the request level if you want a specific value.",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Request-Id',           value: pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}') });",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Request-Tracking-Id',  value: pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}') });",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Request-Session-Id',   value: pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}') });"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Generic assertions that fit every endpoint.",
          "pm.test('content-type is JSON when body present', function () {",
          "    if (pm.response.code === 204 || pm.response.code === 404) return;",
          "    pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type') || '').to.match(/application\\/json/i);",
          "});",
          "pm.test('not 401/403 (token still valid)', function () {",
          "    pm.expect([401, 403]).to.not.include(pm.response.code);",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "https://teai.st.sk:8243/omni/test1",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Party Management 3.54.0",
      "description": "`/party-management/3.54.0/v2/parties` — where rodné číslo / OP / pas / IČO live as `Identification` records under a Party. See [`dps-party-mgmt-api`](file:///Users/michaljurco/.claude/skills/dps-party-mgmt-api/SKILL.md) skill.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Search by rodné číslo (socialSecurityNumber)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/party-management/3.54.0/v2/parties?identificationId={{rodne_cislo}}&identificationType=socialSecurityNumber&fields=*",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["party-management", "3.54.0", "v2", "parties"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "identificationId", "value": "{{rodne_cislo}}" },
                { "key": "identificationType", "value": "socialSecurityNumber" },
                { "key": "fields", "value": "*" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns `Party[]` — empty array means not found (HTTP 200 []).\n\nMapping for the Slovak market:\n- `rodne_cislo` (RČ, 9–10 digits) → `identificationType=socialSecurityNumber`"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Search by OP (nationalIdentityCard)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/party-management/3.54.0/v2/parties?identificationId={{op}}&identificationType=nationalIdentityCard&fields=*",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["party-management", "3.54.0", "v2", "parties"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "identificationId", "value": "{{op}}" },
                { "key": "identificationType", "value": "nationalIdentityCard" },
                { "key": "fields", "value": "*" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "OP format: 2 uppercase letters + 6 digits (e.g. `AB123456`)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Search by passport",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/party-management/3.54.0/v2/parties?identificationId={{pas}}&identificationType=passport&fields=*",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["party-management", "3.54.0", "v2", "parties"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "identificationId", "value": "{{pas}}" },
                { "key": "identificationType", "value": "passport" },
                { "key": "fields", "value": "*" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Passport format: 1–2 uppercase letters + 6–8 digits (e.g. `BR154151`)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Search by IČO (subjectRegistrationId)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/party-management/3.54.0/v2/parties?identificationId={{ico}}&identificationType=subjectRegistrationId&fields=*",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["party-management", "3.54.0", "v2", "parties"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "identificationId", "value": "{{ico}}" },
                { "key": "identificationType", "value": "subjectRegistrationId" },
                { "key": "fields", "value": "*" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "IČO format: exactly 8 digits. Lives on `Party.organization.organizationIdentifications[]`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get party by id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/party-management/3.54.0/v2/parties/{{party_id}}?fields=*",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["party-management", "3.54.0", "v2", "parties", "{{party_id}}"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "fields", "value": "*" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Single Party record by ID (e.g. `PARTY_1002203200`)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get party with matching probability (dedup)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/party-management/3.54.0/v2/parties/{{party_id}}?fields=*&hasMatchingSources=true",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["party-management", "3.54.0", "v2", "parties", "{{party_id}}"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "fields", "value": "*" },
                { "key": "hasMatchingSources", "value": "true" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Adds duplicate-detection probabilities into `relatedParties[].characteristics[]`. Useful when investigating multi-match scenarios (e.g. the polluted test environment returns ~450 parties for some RČ values)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
